  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1004.21 Expansion, Relocation, or Replacement of Existing Structures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1004.21 Expansion, Relocation, or Replacement of Existing Structures.\n\n(a) Any person seeking construction approval or approval to operate from the department for the expansion, relocation, or replacement of any structure shall comply with RSA 485-A:38.\n\n(b) For property in the protected shoreland, no structure shall be replaced, relocated, or expanded without the owner first determining that such replacement, relocation, or expansion will not violate RSA 483-B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1004.22)",
